@qianmo978/dsh-kilo-gateway README · Kilo Gateway：A DeepSeek Harness plugin that turns the **Kilo Code Gateway** into a first-party model
provider, ported from [`@kilocode/kilo-gateway`](https://github.com/Kilo-Org/kilocode/tree/main/packages/kilo-gateway)
(MIT).

@qianmo978/dsh-kilo-gateway README · What this plugin depends on：**No external package.** The bundle imports nothing but Node builtins and, in the browser half,
`react` (which the web shell's module table provides). The schema library is vendored under
`vendor/`, and `tools/verify-installable.mjs` enforces that rule.

@qianmo978/dsh-kilo-gateway README · Why the schema library is vendored：```js
for (const entry of readdirSync(join(hostNodeModulesRoot(dir), '@deepseek-ai'))) {
  if (/^(?:dsh|cordis)/.test(entry.name)) names.add(`@deepseek-ai/${entry.name}`)
}
```

`schemastery` matches neither prefix, so it is **never routed**. It has to be resolvable from the
plugin's own directory, the way Node resolves it.

@qianmo978/dsh-kilo-gateway README · The stream chunks the adapter emits：The adapter yields `StreamChunk`s, and the host validates each one as it arrives:

```ts
type StreamChunk =
  | { type: 'block-start'; index: number; blockType: ContentBlockType }
  | { type: 'text-delta'; index: number; text: string }
  | { type: 'reasoning-delta'; index: number; text: string }

The `id` on a `tool-call-delta` is **required, and required on every delta**:

```js
if (typeof chunk.id !== "string") throw new TypeError("tool-call-delta id must be a string")
```

@qianmo978/dsh-kilo-gateway README · Credential records：The record half of the credentials seam is a **discriminated union**, not a free-form bag:

```ts
type CredentialRecord = ApiKeyRecord | GrantRecord
interface ApiKeyRecord { kind: 'api-key'; key?: string; env?: Record<string,string> }
interface GrantRecord  { kind: 'grant';   payload: unknown }
```

